    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Designation Force",
    "summary": "Your **SCOUT SENTINEL** and **ASTRA MILITARUM INFANTRY SMOKE** units get this ability:\n\n**Signal Flares**: during [your Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), the unit can pick a [visible](vsdata:core-rule/visibility) enemy unit up to 12\" from it. That enemy unit becomes **designated**, which gives it +3\" **detection range**.\n\nCarrying the **RECON** tag, this Detachment cannot be taken alongside another **RECON** Detachment.",
